1
00:01:27,600 --> 00:01:29,120
Why don't you sit on it?

2
00:01:29,200 --> 00:01:30,440
See if it fits.

3
00:01:37,680 --> 00:01:38,800
Annie's chair

4
00:01:38,920 --> 00:01:40,200
is indeed a little hard.

5
00:01:40,840 --> 00:01:43,480
But the size is quite right.

6
00:01:44,680 --> 00:01:45,760
Thanks to you.

7
00:01:46,160 --> 00:01:46,880
It's you

8
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:48,760
who started this storm,

9
00:01:49,440 --> 00:01:50,760
putting the company in jeopardy.

10
00:01:53,160 --> 00:01:54,000
But

11
00:01:54,480 --> 00:01:56,120
there has to be someone to steer the ship.

12
00:01:56,960 --> 00:01:58,200
To live is to face death.

13
00:01:58,200 --> 00:01:59,240
Nothing can be established without being destroyed.

14
00:01:59,400 --> 00:02:00,280
Isn't it?

15
00:02:01,880 --> 00:02:02,640
Just say it.

16
00:02:03,200 --> 00:02:04,440
You come to me today

17
00:02:04,960 --> 00:02:06,840
to talk about the proposal of the charity fund, right?

18
00:02:10,600 --> 00:02:11,920
Your idea is bold

19
00:02:12,160 --> 00:02:13,040
and smart.

20
00:02:13,400 --> 00:02:14,760
It maximizes the recovery of

21
00:02:14,760 --> 00:02:16,480
the company's reputation at its lowest ebb.

22
00:02:16,680 --> 00:02:18,200
and if executed properly,

23
00:02:18,320 --> 00:02:21,280
it could also be a highly talked-about large-scale marketing campaign.

24
00:02:21,520 --> 00:02:22,920
I can approve it.

25
00:02:23,400 --> 00:02:24,000
As expected,

26
00:02:24,280 --> 00:02:25,720
in the eyes of a pure capitalist,

27
00:02:25,840 --> 00:02:27,200
everything can be turned into business.

28
00:02:27,320 --> 00:02:29,240
But you would just nod so easily,

29
00:02:29,600 --> 00:02:31,040
which doesn't seem like your style.

30
00:02:33,040 --> 00:02:33,920
Five years,

31
00:02:34,840 --> 00:02:36,760
ten percent of annual profit

32
00:02:36,920 --> 00:02:38,920
will be invested in your fund.

33
00:02:39,680 --> 00:02:40,760
Five years

34
00:02:41,040 --> 00:02:42,720
are enough to reshape the brand image

35
00:02:43,040 --> 00:02:44,400
and build confidence in the capital market.

36
00:02:44,800 --> 00:02:45,840
That's the bottom line.

37
00:02:45,960 --> 00:02:47,680
I want 90%.

38
00:02:50,680 --> 00:02:51,480
Jiang Li,

39
00:02:51,720 --> 00:02:53,840
when Annie can't protect herself

40
00:02:53,840 --> 00:02:56,000
and can't exercise her shareholder rights,

41
00:02:56,560 --> 00:02:57,120
I

42
00:02:57,240 --> 00:02:58,080
am the one

43
00:02:58,240 --> 00:02:59,480
with the most say here.

44
00:03:00,440 --> 00:03:01,560
You have no bargaining chips

45
00:03:01,880 --> 00:03:03,560
to negotiate with me.

46
00:03:05,800 --> 00:03:07,320
It seems that you have forgotten

47
00:03:07,400 --> 00:03:08,640
who made it possible

48
00:03:08,640 --> 00:03:10,320
for you to be here.

49
00:03:13,640 --> 00:03:15,000
Well said.

50
00:03:15,760 --> 00:03:17,200
In the business world,

51
00:03:17,720 --> 00:03:19,880
sacrificing pawns is common.

52
00:03:21,000 --> 00:03:22,280
What matters most is

53
00:03:22,880 --> 00:03:24,360
who wins

54
00:03:24,640 --> 00:03:26,200
in the end.

55
00:03:26,360 --> 00:03:27,280
will be me.

56
00:03:28,600 --> 00:03:30,560
I can destroy the Lu family and Annie,

57
00:03:30,840 --> 00:03:33,120
and there are many ways to dismantle Golden Thread.

58
00:03:33,360 --> 00:03:34,160
Oh,

59
00:03:35,920 --> 00:03:37,440
are you threatening me?

60
00:03:37,640 --> 00:03:39,120
I'm just reminding you,

61
00:03:39,360 --> 00:03:40,760
if this company

62
00:03:40,760 --> 00:03:43,400
can't atone for the sins of Annie,

63
00:03:43,400 --> 00:03:45,600
then it has no reason to exist.

64
00:03:47,560 --> 00:03:48,880
No need to make it so complicated.

65
00:04:01,360 --> 00:04:02,440
This is a 20% share transfer agreement

66
00:04:02,440 --> 00:04:04,640
of Morgan's shares.

67
00:04:05,520 --> 00:04:06,640
Now,

68
00:04:07,320 --> 00:04:08,600
I'm the holder.

69
00:04:15,640 --> 00:04:16,520
Impossible.

70
00:04:16,680 --> 00:04:18,760
I've confirmed with Morgan.

71
00:04:18,760 --> 00:04:21,720
They won't easily give up these core shares.

72
00:04:21,960 --> 00:04:23,600
What if the conditions I offered

73
00:04:25,200 --> 00:04:26,520
are too good to refuse?

74
00:04:27,480 --> 00:04:28,160
Alright.

75
00:04:28,560 --> 00:04:29,880
Tell me what conditions

76
00:04:29,880 --> 00:04:30,840
you offered them

77
00:04:30,840 --> 00:04:32,240
that they can't refuse.

78
00:04:32,800 --> 00:04:34,960
The entire equity of Ruisheng Technology under my name.

79
00:04:36,040 --> 00:04:37,120
The entire equity?

80
00:04:40,400 --> 00:04:41,120
What?

81
00:04:45,080 --> 00:04:46,720
Are you kidding me?

82
00:04:47,920 --> 00:04:50,440
You're trading a tech company valued at billions

83
00:04:50,440 --> 00:04:53,760
for a 20% equity in the shaky Golden Thread?

84
00:04:53,760 --> 00:04:54,760
Are you crazy?

85
00:04:55,080 --> 00:04:55,880
Sister-in-law,

86
00:04:56,600 --> 00:04:58,040
I told you long ago,

87
00:04:58,880 --> 00:05:00,800
if you're against Jiang Li,

88
00:05:01,440 --> 00:05:03,200
I want to try

89
00:05:03,200 --> 00:05:04,880
to fight with all my strength.

90
00:05:05,920 --> 00:05:07,720
If you still want to struggle,

91
00:05:09,240 --> 00:05:10,640
I'll accompany you to the end.

92
00:05:15,040 --> 00:05:15,800
Fine.

93
00:05:17,800 --> 00:05:20,080
Even if you hold 20% of the equity

94
00:05:20,280 --> 00:05:21,720
to support her proposal,

95
00:05:22,360 --> 00:05:23,760
according to her plan,

96
00:05:24,560 --> 00:05:25,880
90% of the annual profit

97
00:05:25,880 --> 00:05:28,680
of Golden Thread will be used for charity.

98
00:05:29,120 --> 00:05:31,280
It's like weaning a baby from breastfeeding.

99
00:05:31,640 --> 00:05:33,440
Golden Thread will collapse sooner or later.

100
00:05:33,600 --> 00:05:34,400
Sister-in-law,

101
00:05:35,080 --> 00:05:36,160
I'm not a capitalist,

102
00:05:36,160 --> 00:05:37,880
and I'm not interested in business.

103
00:05:38,400 --> 00:05:39,280
Weighing the pros and cons,

104
00:05:39,280 --> 00:05:40,320
calculating gains and losses,

105
00:05:40,720 --> 00:05:41,840
are never

106
00:05:42,840 --> 00:05:43,880
important to me.

107
00:05:48,080 --> 00:05:49,520
Are you crazy?

108
00:06:10,120 --> 00:06:12,080
[31.8 yuan paid.]

109
00:06:23,240 --> 00:06:24,040
What's wrong?

110
00:06:24,240 --> 00:06:25,680
Why didn't you tell me

111
00:06:26,000 --> 00:06:27,160
you ran away from the hospital?

112
00:06:28,200 --> 00:06:28,600
I...

113
00:06:29,000 --> 00:06:30,240
I just woke up and

114
00:06:30,240 --> 00:06:31,760
came to see you.

115
00:06:31,960 --> 00:06:33,600
You ran away from the hospital?

116
00:07:02,720 --> 00:07:04,320
Go back after dinner.

117
00:07:04,920 --> 00:07:05,400
Okay.

118
00:07:08,840 --> 00:07:10,920
Ruisheng Technology is worth billions.

119
00:07:11,200 --> 00:07:12,360
and you just gave it away like that?

120
00:07:13,760 --> 00:07:15,280
Was it really worth it?

121
00:07:19,480 --> 00:07:21,000
If I hadn't done this,

122
00:07:21,960 --> 00:07:23,760
would you have tried everything,

123
00:07:23,760 --> 00:07:24,920
even risking your life,

124
00:07:32,840 --> 00:07:34,320
just to walk away unharmed,

125
00:07:34,400 --> 00:07:36,440
put a period on your dark past,

126
00:07:36,600 --> 00:07:38,440
and let you stand in the light again?

127
00:07:38,800 --> 00:07:41,760
It's just a small company. What's the big deal?

128
00:07:43,320 --> 00:07:44,680
I read your diary.

129
00:07:45,200 --> 00:07:46,000
Ah?

130
00:07:47,040 --> 00:07:48,280
You've read it all?

131
00:07:48,920 --> 00:07:50,200
When did you read it?

132
00:07:52,600 --> 00:07:53,400
I...

133
00:07:55,920 --> 00:07:57,200
Do you think...

134
00:08:51,120 --> 00:08:52,080
Why are you here?

135
00:08:52,560 --> 00:08:53,560
Where's Lu Qianqian?

136
00:08:56,600 --> 00:08:57,480
She can't come.

137
00:08:59,480 --> 00:09:02,680
Seeing her mother stabbed by you,

138
00:09:03,280 --> 00:09:05,120
it caused her

139
00:09:05,120 --> 00:09:06,600
great trauma.

140
00:09:07,640 --> 00:09:08,640
The doctor said

141
00:09:09,960 --> 00:09:13,160
she might need a long time

142
00:09:13,160 --> 00:09:14,880
to recover psychologically.

143
00:09:16,040 --> 00:09:18,880
And she may never recover.

144
00:09:19,760 --> 00:09:21,040
What about Mumu?

145
00:09:21,280 --> 00:09:22,360
Who's taking care of

146
00:09:22,600 --> 00:09:23,520
my son?

147
00:09:29,120 --> 00:09:32,280
Of course, it's me, his

148
00:09:33,560 --> 00:09:36,520
legally recognized biological father.

149
00:09:37,040 --> 00:09:38,720
Mumu is my son.

150
00:09:38,960 --> 00:09:40,120
Mumu is my son.

151
00:09:40,440 --> 00:09:42,400
He's the son of Lu Qianqian and me.

152
00:09:49,240 --> 00:09:50,040
Lu Xu,

153
00:09:51,400 --> 00:09:53,960
not to mention how many years you'll be sentenced for this.

154
00:09:54,680 --> 00:09:55,480
Ten years?

155
00:09:56,160 --> 00:09:57,120
Or 20 years?

156
00:09:58,280 --> 00:10:00,880
Even if you are released from prison one day,

157
00:10:01,560 --> 00:10:02,960
when you see the grown-up Mumu,

158
00:10:02,960 --> 00:10:04,320
what do you expect him to call you?

159
00:10:05,800 --> 00:10:06,640
I'm afraid

160
00:10:10,280 --> 00:10:11,800
he can only call you uncle.

161
00:10:14,600 --> 00:10:15,560
Zhou Jian,

162
00:10:16,640 --> 00:10:19,600
you are truly despicable to the core.

163
00:10:20,040 --> 00:10:20,840
Indeed.

164
00:10:24,160 --> 00:10:24,960
Raising

165
00:10:25,960 --> 00:10:28,720
the child of the person who dragged me into the abyss

166
00:10:29,840 --> 00:10:32,200
as if he's my own flesh and blood

167
00:10:32,320 --> 00:10:34,080
is the biggest punishment for me.

168
00:10:35,600 --> 00:10:36,240
And you

169
00:10:37,760 --> 00:10:38,760
can never

170
00:10:38,760 --> 00:10:40,640
tell him who you are openly.

171
00:10:40,760 --> 00:10:42,680
You can never give him

172
00:10:42,680 --> 00:10:43,800
as a father.

173
00:10:44,520 --> 00:10:46,440
This is the biggest punishment for you.

174
00:11:12,440 --> 00:11:13,560
I forgot to tell you.

175
00:11:15,920 --> 00:11:17,320
Mumu has changed his name.

176
00:11:18,960 --> 00:11:20,120
From now on,

177
00:11:29,800 --> 00:11:30,800
he's called Zhou Mu.

178
00:12:06,640 --> 00:12:07,680
Congratulations.

179
00:12:07,760 --> 00:12:08,480
Jiang Li,

180
00:12:10,040 --> 00:12:11,480
your plan is completed.

181
00:12:11,960 --> 00:12:14,800
You've completely ruined the Lu family,

182
00:12:15,200 --> 00:12:16,200
and broken.

183
00:12:16,720 --> 00:12:17,720
Are you satisfied?

184
00:12:18,800 --> 00:12:19,600
Thank you.

185
00:12:21,360 --> 00:12:22,480
Lu Xu,

186
00:12:23,320 --> 00:12:24,560
you woke up long ago,

187
00:12:24,560 --> 00:12:25,360
didn't you?

188
00:12:26,240 --> 00:12:27,480
What did you tell him?

189
00:12:28,160 --> 00:12:30,480
I just told him the truth.

190
00:12:31,640 --> 00:12:32,600
What truth?

191
00:12:34,360 --> 00:12:35,360
About you,

192
00:12:35,800 --> 00:12:36,600
about him,

193
00:12:36,920 --> 00:12:37,880
about Annie,

194
00:12:38,320 --> 00:12:39,640
and about the Lu family.

195
00:12:40,240 --> 00:12:42,840
The dirtiest and funniest truth.

196
00:12:45,400 --> 00:12:47,840
Back then, Grandpa Lu and Annie had a business marriage.

197
00:12:48,320 --> 00:12:49,360
They were like oil and water.

198
00:12:49,400 --> 00:12:51,320
Each had their own lover,

199
00:12:51,360 --> 00:12:52,600
and each had a child.

200
00:12:52,760 --> 00:12:54,000
The funniest thing is

201
00:12:54,120 --> 00:12:57,160
the due dates of these two children are on the same day.

202
00:12:58,040 --> 00:12:59,120
I know that.

203
00:12:59,960 --> 00:13:02,080
But there's something else you don't know.

204
00:13:02,920 --> 00:13:05,280
Grandpa Lu's mistress gave birth to a boy,

205
00:13:05,760 --> 00:13:07,520
while Annie gave birth to a girl.

206
00:13:14,400 --> 00:13:17,200
Lu Xu's mother died of postpartum hemorrhage,

207
00:13:17,600 --> 00:13:20,600
and Grandpa Lu was diagnosed with cancer.

208
00:13:21,240 --> 00:13:23,760
So he set up a perfect trap for Annie.

209
00:13:24,720 --> 00:13:26,480
He switched the two babies

210
00:13:26,480 --> 00:13:28,280
when Annie was unconscious,

211
00:13:28,440 --> 00:13:30,760
and sent you to the orphanage

212
00:13:31,080 --> 00:13:32,880
to be raised by Dean Li.

213
00:13:33,000 --> 00:13:36,640
He told Dean Li not to stop Annie from adopting you.

214
00:13:37,280 --> 00:13:39,160
To get the 30% inheritance

215
00:13:39,160 --> 00:13:42,120
from Grandpa Lu's will,

216
00:13:43,000 --> 00:13:44,760
Annie went to the orphanage to adopt you.

217
00:13:47,240 --> 00:13:48,880
Annie has been calculating

218
00:13:49,120 --> 00:13:50,280
and fighting for a lifetime.

219
00:13:50,720 --> 00:13:53,720
She has been working hard for others.

220
00:13:54,600 --> 00:13:56,960
She even diluted and transferred her own daughter's shares

221
00:13:57,880 --> 00:14:00,480
to that substitute.

222
00:14:02,400 --> 00:14:03,680
You come here today

223
00:14:04,440 --> 00:14:06,240
just to tell me this?

224
00:14:12,320 --> 00:14:13,640
If you're done,

225
00:14:14,880 --> 00:14:16,560
please leave now.

226
00:14:18,960 --> 00:14:20,440
I don't want to see you anymore.

227
00:14:35,800 --> 00:14:36,600
By the way,

228
00:14:37,120 --> 00:14:38,960
I forgot to tell you something.

229
00:14:44,560 --> 00:14:45,640
I know

230
00:14:46,560 --> 00:14:49,240
you were the one who stabbed Annie that day.

231
00:14:49,880 --> 00:14:50,920
And Lu Xu

232
00:14:51,920 --> 00:14:53,680
just took the blame for you.
